### ================================================================
### 🔑 Hidden Gems SL — Real Backend & API Validation Tests
### VS Code REST Client Extension හරහා run කරන්න
### Extension: humao.rest-client
###
### 📌 How to Use:
###   1. පහළ "▶ Send Request" button එක click කරලා ඔයාගේ Local Backends සහ APIs චෙක් කරන්න
###   2. ✅ = 200/OK (Server & AI working!), ❌ = Connection refused / 401 / 500
### ================================================================

### ── 🔧 Local & BYOM Variables (ඔයාගේ Local Endpoints මෙතන තියෙන්නේ) ──
@python_backend     = http://localhost:8000/api
@laravel_backend    = http://localhost:8888/api/v1
@internal_api_key   = dev-key-local
@test_firebase_token = YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE

### ================================================================
### 🏛️ PART 1: REAL PYTHON FASTAPI BACKEND TESTS (Port 8000)
###    මෙම පරීක්ෂණ හරහා ඔයාගේ Python Backend එකෙහි සැබෑම Endpoints වැඩදැයි බලාගත හැක.
### ================================================================

### 1️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — ROOT HEALTH CHECK
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + {"message": "Hidden Gems SL Secure API is running", "version": ...}
# @name python_root_health
GET http://localhost:8000/

###

### 2️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — WEATHER ALERTS TEST (Monsoon Monitor)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Weather alerts JSON (Public endpoint)
# @name python_weather_alerts
GET {{python_backend}}/weather/alerts

###

### 3️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — CURRENT WEATHER TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Current weather JSON (Public endpoint)
# @name python_weather_current
GET {{python_backend}}/weather/current?district=Colombo

###

### 4️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — AUTH USER SYNC / LOGIN
###    📌 Syncs Firebase ID token with local database. Critical step for token validation!
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + User Profile JSON {"id": ..., "email": ..., "tier": ...}
# @name python_auth_sync
POST {{python_backend}}/auth/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "{{test_firebase_token}}"
}

###

### 5️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — GET CURRENT USER PROFILE (/me)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Current user profile
# @name python_auth_me
GET {{python_backend}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{test_firebase_token}}

###

### 6️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — PLACES LIST TEST (Secured Endpoint)
###    📌 Header: Option A -> Authorization: Bearer <token> OR Option B -> X-Admin-Internal-Key: dev-key-local
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + List of discovery places
# @name python_places_list
GET {{python_backend}}/places
X-Admin-Internal-Key: {{internal_api_key}}

###

### 7️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — AI SEMANTIC SEARCH TEST (Secured Endpoint)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Places matching query
# @name python_ai_semantic_search
GET {{python_backend}}/ai/search/semantic?query=waterfall
X-Admin-Internal-Key: {{internal_api_key}}

###

### 8️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — AI ITINERARY PLANNER TEST (Secured Endpoint)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Generated itinerary
# @name python_ai_itinerary
POST {{python_backend}}/ai/plan-itinerary
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Internal-Key: {{internal_api_key}}

{
  "destination": "Kandy",
  "days": 2,
  "style": "balanced",
  "budget_lkr": 50000
}

###

### 9️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — AI TRANSLATION TEST (Secured Endpoint)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Translated Sinhala/English text
# @name python_ai_translate
POST {{python_backend}}/ai/translate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Internal-Key: {{internal_api_key}}

{
  "text": "Welcome to Sri Lanka, the pearl of the Indian Ocean!",
  "target_lang": "si"
}

###

### 🔟 PYTHON BACKEND — PIPELINE STATUS TEST (Secured Endpoint)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Pipeline execution status
# @name python_pipeline_status
GET {{python_backend}}/pipeline/status
X-Admin-Internal-Key: {{internal_api_key}}

###

### 1️⃣0️⃣a️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — LUMEN-1 AI STATUS TEST (BYOM)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Lumen AI status
# @name python_lumen_status
GET {{python_backend}}/status

###

### 1️⃣0️⃣b️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — LUMEN-1 AI INFERENCE TEST (BYOM)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Generated response
# @name python_lumen_inference
POST {{python_backend}}/test-model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What are the top waterfalls in Ella, Sri Lanka?",
  "use_rag": true,
  "mode": "default"
}

###

### 1️⃣0️⃣c️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — FOOD SCAN AI TEST (BYOM)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Identified dish profile
# @name python_food_scan
POST {{python_backend}}/food/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": "data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQEASABIAAD/2wBDAP//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////wgALCAABAAEBAREA/8QAFBABAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP/aAAgBAQABPxA=",
  "user_mode": "Tourist",
  "spice_preference": "Medium"
}

###

### 1️⃣0️⃣d️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — AI RECOMMENDATIONS TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Recommended places JSON
# @name python_ai_recommendations
POST {{python_backend}}/ai/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Internal-Key: {{internal_api_key}}

{
  "nearbyPlaces": [
    {"id": "1", "name": "Diyaluma Falls", "category": "nature_scenic", "distanceKm": 1.2}
  ],
  "vibeText": "adventure"
}

###


### ================================================================
### 🏛️ PART 2: REAL LARAVEL GATEWAY TESTS (Port 8888)
###    මෙම පරීක්ෂණ හරහා ඔයාගේ Laravel Gateway එකෙහි සැබෑම Endpoints වැඩදැයි බලාගත හැක.
### ================================================================

### 1️⃣1️⃣ LARAVEL GATEWAY — PLACE SYNC VERSION CHECK
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + {"version": ...}
# @name laravel_sync_test
GET {{laravel_backend}}/places/check-version
X-API-KEY: {{internal_api_key}}

###

### 1️⃣2️⃣ LARAVEL GATEWAY → PYTHON AI PROXY TEST (Itinerary Planner)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + TripItinerary JSON generated by Python via Laravel Proxy
# @name laravel_ai_proxy_test
POST {{laravel_backend}}/ai/plan-itinerary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Kandy",
  "days": 2,
  "style": "balanced",
  "budget_lkr": 50000
}

###

### 1️⃣2️⃣a️⃣ LARAVEL GATEWAY → PYTHON AI PROXY TEST (Recommendations)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Recommended places JSON generated by Python via Laravel Proxy
# @name laravel_ai_recommendations_proxy_test
POST {{laravel_backend}}/ai/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nearbyPlaces": [
    {"id": "1", "name": "Diyaluma Falls", "category": "nature_scenic", "distanceKm": 1.2}
  ],
  "vibeText": "adventure"
}

